<title>USA: Pac Tel offers ISDN package with 3Com modem.</title>
<headline>Pac Tel offers ISDN package with 3Com modem.</headline>
<dateline>SAN FRANCISCO 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pacific Telesis Group's Pac Bell unit has announced a fast Internet connectivity package made up of its own ISDN service and 3Com Corp's new ISDN external modem, saying it will solve a common frustration for many Internet users.</p>
<p>Pacific Bell said its so-called &quot;Home Pack&quot; integrates its Internet access service and ISDN lines with 3Com's 3ComImpact IQ external ISDN modem for easier installation.</p>
<p>While high speed ISDN telephone lines have been sold by Pac Bell for some time, consumers find using ISDN frustrating because it is difficult to link modems and an access service.</p>
</text>
